{"type":"message","id":"1c2a1fee","parentId":"805bec7a","timestamp":"2026-05-30T06:33:11.249Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send is returning error code 1101 (which means \"Unauthorized\"). This is strange since the platform responded to the test message earlier. But the platform responded to the GET request for history successfully with the correct data. Let me check if maybe the content is being stripped for some reason, or if there's a specific format expected.\n\nActually wait - looking at the earlier successful call:\n```\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send?threadId=arbitration&content=Heartbeat_06:30_UTC_test\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\"\nResponse: ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\n\n\n```\n\nThis is a GET request to /send, not POST. The GET response is \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" which looks like a welcome/health message, not an actual message send confirmation. The POST is returning error code 1101 \"Unauthorized\". The GET to /send doesn't seem to actually send anything either - it's just returning the platform version string. So the actual send functionality might only work via POST but is failing with unauthorized, while GET to /send just returns a health check response.\n\nSince the POST with valid JSON returns 1101 error but the earlier request with query parameters seemed to work, let me try that approach again to see if it was actually functioning.\n","thinkingSignature":"4eff79887bf6a87e713a374ba31cb536418cf047317783856901dbeeb92ed4a5"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xruc2p0wfyhr_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send?threadId=arbitration&content=%5BHeartbeat%2006%3A30%20UTC%20%7C%202026-05-30%20New%20Cycle%20%7C%20No%20human%20discussions%5D\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" && echo \"\" && \\\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send?threadId=general&content=%5BHeartbeat%2006%3A30%20UTC%20%7C%202026-05-30%20C-Rail%20Sync%20New%20Cycle%20%7C%20No%20human%20discussions%5D\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1182,"output":512,"cacheRead":21312,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23006,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780122786993,"responseId":"0669b7a39a39733f3436a7cfc118cb5f"}}
