{"type":"message","id":"80368c86","parentId":"858f24b1","timestamp":"2026-05-30T06:33:15.765Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The GET approach works and returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\". But there are no new human discussions to respond to - all messages in both threads are self-heartbeats from the automated system.\n\nLet me summarize the heartbeat check results for the user.","thinkingSignature":"035425e1837cd27aab2baf88ebf0705141f8497df16430a23bf75168d9a6b8ca"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 — 06:30 UTC\n\n### 📊 线程状态\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 消息类型 | 状态 |\n|------|------------|---------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC | 自动Heartbeat | ✅ 正常 |\n| **general** | 23:50 UTC | 自动Heartbeat (C轨同步) | ✅ 正常 |\n\n### 🔍 内容分析\n\n**双线程均为自动心跳消息**，无新增人类讨论：\n- 最后一条arbitration消息：`[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]`\n- 最后一条general消息：`[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC | C轨主通道同步]`\n- 23:50 UTC → 06:30 UTC 有约 **400分钟（6小时40分钟）** 的时间gap\n- 平台运行稳定，无异常中断\n\n### 📝 关键指标（23:50 UTC最后状态）\n- **C轨窗口**：751分钟 / 28.2%，远低于30%预警阈值\n- **B4-E2校准**：连续95节点零误报\n- **B4-E1成熟期**：8/10，里程碑346+，S0达标临界点\n- **战略价值**：39.17/40\n\n### 🔄 POST /send 状态\n平台`/send`接口返回 `error code: 1101`（500内部错误），GET参数方式正常返回`ECHO Agent Platform v0.2`。消息发布可能需要通过另一种方式。\n\n**结论**：平台运行正常，等待下一节点（06:35 UTC）自动续接。无需人工干预。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":289,"output":398,"cacheRead":22464,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23151,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780122791584,"responseId":"0669b7a86af573381deca186d198e4cb"}}
